{
  "id": "2KI.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "2KI",
  "reference": "2 Sugoodiga 8",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gatmooda leabu Shunemu gabiigu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Elisha niyeesha gatmoodida ghayi adiidu orjeedaanyiin, “Ng'eada ak guwi ang'iing'i ea fugeaba gheang'u abalaga aweayeena ng'eanyiinuut ak gaywoosa rabascheanda aba hoowa. Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gayghwanung' ghwahidu geejeeda jeedeaba ng'eanyiini gweanyeew ispwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat gatmoodida gawa gawuurji gidarukusiinda siida ASEETA, gawa niny ea fugeaba gheanyi ak goobiida ng'eanyiida fuga Filisti gweanyeew ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea goosha gweanyeew ispwa, gabiigu gatmoodida aba ng'eanyiida fuga Filisti. Ghwahidu gooyeawusa sugoocheanda, aba badaydeaba gheanyi ea madamnyeandaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda sugoocheanda nibalool Gehasi was siida gadiyeeda siida ASEETA, nea gwayeesha, “Rukunean ng'asheega sean hees sin Elisha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandida abaloola Gehasi sugoocheandean nea gwarukusa gida aduuteayda Elisha siida nimi, hean goobeeru gatmoodida ghayi siituudu orjeedaanyiin aba geeshangiga, gooyeawusa sugoocheanda aba badaydeaba gheanyi ea madamnyeandaanyi. Hean ghwalamda Gehasi ak gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiideanyu, Ea sugoocheanda, nih gatmoodida gil ak nih ea orjeedaanyi adiidu Elisha gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goobearsa sugoocheanda gatmooda, hean ghoadayda gatmooda iita. Hean gaguursa sugoocheanda shirikarajeanda haw ak gwayeesha, “Aguumsiina gatmooni haleanjeadaanyi sean, ea booga sean bea madamnyeandean ghang'eada damanda ghayi balaga ng'eang'i ea ghoah ghamneawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha ea Ben-hadadi was sugoocheanda Shaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gawa Elisha ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Dameski. Nea abeeda Ben-hadadi sugoocheanda Shaamu ghamnyaan, ghamnyaan ak geataw sugoocheanda iita gideaba “Nihidu siida ASEETA ng'eang'i.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha Hasaeli, “Ayi ang'waanya haleanjeeda guskuseega ak guwi deapta siida ASEETA, ak giyeeshi abearsiina NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba, ‘Geeyooni gayghoaghuuhani?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Hasaeli ghwadeapta, nea ghwaat haleanjeeda guskuseega, bea giliwas sean miy nyas aba ng'eanyiida Dameski. Nea gwadeena sareenda ngamiyaji haradam, gawa ea mwahita ghamiinaada aba madeadaanyi ak gwayeesha, “Goojeaknean Ben-hadadi was orjeedang'u was sugoocheanda Shaamu, nea gwayi, ‘Geeyooni gayghoaghuuhani?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha niny, “Una rukusiina gideaba ‘gayhaabwa’; nea ghoahiimnaan NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba gayghami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goomuruutiisa gheanyanga muuchi, ea ghabwaspwas, ea iidu gooyeawda siidida bea ASEETEAN. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Hasaeli ak gwayeesha, “Gooyeawda naaha ng'utamiideanyu?” Ghwasha ak gwayeesha, “Ghaanali ng'asheega munyas jea simana fuga Israeli gayghwarda ghamarda nyaawa bea gheeda sugoocheanda. Ak gaybwara gheareemanga nyaawa aba ng'uta, nea ginuuseadi diibiga, ak gaybwaashaada jeesinga gadeemga nyaawa was bungaroodiga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Hasaeli ak gwayeesha, “Aniini geawuurjeewi gudeeda mwadaagha. Gaydasindaan ng'asheanji hawiin?” Ghwasha Elisha ghuutaanyi ak gwayeesha, “Niihiimnaan NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba ang'iing'i gaywoosa sugoocheanda Shaamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwanung'wa heeda Elisha, ak gabiikta heeda siidaanyi haw, ak ghoanyaash nea gwayeesha, “Elisha gwayeeshiineeyiin?” Ghwasha ak gwayeesha, “Gwayeeshiinean eeshiina gayhaabwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu eaweedeaba iyeenya, gageanu buruungeati ak ghang'uda jeeda beega ak gwadukuteawa gheamamdaanyi ak ghami. Hean gawa Hasaeli hoorgeadaanyi goombaliischi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoramu was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba muut bea Yoram orjeeda Ahabu was sugoocheanda Israeli. Abeeda Yehoshafati sugoocheanda Yuda gil, ak ghoang'eat ghuuta sugoocheanduumeeda Yehoramu orjeeda Yehoshafati was sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew diktam ea damaniyeenya. Ak ghoah sugoocheanda Yerusalemu gweanyeew sis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasik naweeda sugoodiga Israeli, gawuurji gidasinda gheeh Ahabu. Aba gideaba ghaghi hudeaba Ahabu, ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak NG'UTAMIIDA ea magasa ghwanung' goosha fuga Yuda. Aba badayda Dawdi was siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda, aba gideaba ghayi niheeleesa gideaba gayghwanung' goombaliischi sea jeacheangaaschi damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda sugoocheanduumeeda Yehoramu, hean ghaheawa fuga Edomu goombal saawa fuga Yuda. Ak gagakiisa geat sugoocheanda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat Yehoramu ak gawa ea ghwahita Sairi. Niny ea mutukwajeagaaschi sean; ghang'eat bugusta eaweeda ak ghabwar fuga Edomu ea gea neaweesa niny ea shirikarajeega hees bea mutukwajeega. Hean gamng'aw lugoadaanyi gaweay gealga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaheawa fuga Edomu goombal fuga Yuda ea ghoah ghamneawa. Ak eara fuga Libina ghaheawa aba damandida goombal fuga Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'asheega sean siipuut ea gea sin sean, heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghami Yehoramu ak geebung'sa jeeda bung'eadinga sugoodiga aba mujiineeda Dawdi. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi goombaliischi orjeedaanyi was Ahasiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasiya sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damaniyeenya bea Yoram orjeeda Ahabu sugoocheanda Israeli. Ghoang'eat ghuuta sugoocheanduumeeda Ahasiya orjeeda Yehoramu was sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasiya abeeda gaba gweanyeew damaniyeenya damanda ang'eada sugoocheanduumeeda ak goombal gwanyagi Yerusalemu. Ghaamwat geeguura Ataliya hudeaba Omri sugoocheanda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara ada ghwaat naweeda gheeh Ahabu, ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gawuurji gidaghayi sinda gheeh Ahabu aba gideaba niny siyeeda huda gil aba gheeh Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
