        {
          "text": "Iidu Yoram sugoocheanda gabiigu gawa meajooda aba Yesreeli. Nea geayiin meajooda deaneaduutka ghayi sawan fuga Shaamu aba Rama, damanda ng'ucheewa sea Hasaeli sugoocheanda Shaamu. Hean ghwararang'aan Ahasiya orjeeda Yehoramu sugoocheanda Yuda googeachi Yoram orjeeda Ahabu aba Yesreeli, aba gideaba ghamnyaan.",
